# Join a game already under way: a spectator. SPECTATOR on every screen;
# FIRE does nothing (the server log shows no action from VCS); RESET held
# leaves. Someone else must start the game on table irata first, e.g.
#   curl 'localhost:8096/state?table=irata&player=alice'
#   curl 'localhost:8096/ready/1?table=irata&player=alice'
# and keep polling /state as alice (and /ready/1 at each summary).
